id=oplusdolby
name=Oplus Dolby (stock)
version=v1.8.2
versionCode=182
author=davnozdu
description=Keeps the phone own Oplus/HoloAudio "Dolby" effect in place and lets it be controlled: three mutually exclusive modes (Dolby max = profile 2, Dolby soft = profile 5, own 10-band GEQ = profile 0), the choice and the curve survive reboots. Restores the stock effect libraries only on this model. No DSP of its own.
